# Security & Observability

## RBAC
- Enforce role checks per tool (e.g., Deals update requires Deal Editor)
- Validate DocType permissions via CRM before write ops

## Auth
- Service account session renewal; secure storage of credentials
- CSRF token management; include X-Frappe-CSRF-Token in POSTs

## Auditing
- Tool call audit: { time, user, tool, args_hash, outcome }
- CRM side: Comments/Audit Trail on modified docs

## Rate Limits & Quotas
- Per-user and per-tool limits; exponential backoff on 429

## Logs & Metrics
- CRM: log_error with structured messages; job logs for ETL
- Farfalle: p50/p95 latency per tool, success/error rates, cost

## Privacy
- Mask PII in logs; encrypt tokens; minimize data retention (CSV bodies)